<!DOCTYPE html><html xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml">
<head>
  <title>ConvREL: Conversion of layers between MiraMon formats 1 and
  4.</title>
<meta content="text/html; charset=ISO-8859-1" http-equiv="Content-Type"/></head>

<body>
 <!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent al titol de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<h1><span id="wpstitol"/></h1>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent titol de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->

  <p>This program transforms the links between tables, metadata and symbols
  from older versions to the 4/5 version. It also permits the user to return
  to older versions of the program with more limited features.</p>

  <p>Option 4 requires MM32.exe version 4.0vt (or a later version) in order to
  migrate the symbols.</p>

  <p>The program also permits the fusion of n bands into a single multiband
  raster (in REL4 format), and the opposite action: the liberation of one or
  all bands of a multiband (REL4 format) file.</p>
  <!--Aquí inicia la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<span id="wpsopcions"/>
<!--Aquí acaba la part corresponent a les opcions de de la MSA editable de el WPS.-->
  <hr/>

  <exclusiva>
<!-- Aquí inicia la part corresponent a la sintaxi de miramon. Aquesta part s'ha d'editar desde el document WPS (aplicacio.mps).-->
<span id="wpssintaxi"/>
<!-- Aquí acaba la part corresponent a la sintaxi de miramon editable de el WPS.-->
  </ul>Examples:<br/>
  In order to transform a complete directory to REL4=20 type:<br/>
  ConvREL 4 directorio\*.*<br/>
  On the other hand, in order to transform a directory and all its
  subdirectories recursively, type:<br/>
  ConvREL 4 = directorio\*.* /S<br/>
  <!-- $$EXCLUSIVA$$
Para obtener la ayuda completa escriba:
ConvREL ?
-->
  <hr/>
</body>
</html>